{"id":"1abd919e8caee816","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-rank-bounded-set.md","title":"ZFC Rank Bounded Set","display":"df-zfc-rank-bounded-set — ZFC Rank Bounded Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rank-bounded-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rank-bounded-set"],"display":"df-zfc-rank-bounded-set — ZFC Rank Bounded Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rank-bounded-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rank-bounded-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rank-bounded-set — ZFC Rank Bounded Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(A,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a> 的累积层级。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RankBoundedSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{RankBoundedSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{RankBoundedSet}_S(A,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land A\\subseteq V_\\alpha\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{RankBoundedSet}_S(A,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land A\\subseteq V_\\alpha\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The bound is required to be an ordinal, and the membership clause is written as set inclusion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S$ 使用 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]；$V_\\alpha$ 使用 [[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]] 的累积层级。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S$ 使用 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]；$V_\\alpha$ 使用 [[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]] 的累积层级。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RankBoundedSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rank\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{RankBoundedSet}_S(A,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land A\\subseteq V_\\alpha","display":true}],"bytes":889,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-rank-bounded-set.md|58-df-zfc-rank-bounded-set]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2","aabdf3005231e9dc"]}